{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"16ede35d259bc92c1c8f97eb339fd7108fd8e8c3c0fa493191236174c2a349f1","ja":"サマーフェスの後は……","zh":"夏日庆典之后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"882b7a7ef4262b689bc25526e5f05780c712317f2972f437f25b74bcefcce595","ja":"今日のお仕事はサマーフェスの出演。\n海美と紬は出番が終わって……","zh":"今天的工作是参加夏日音乐节演出。\n海美和紬已经表演完毕……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8ce3780043778dd0a77e4012072c1e4b9018be9efd9e08ac4cc4d7d8e46f9251","ja":"つむりん、お疲れさま～☆　今日はいろんな人の\nステージが見れて、最高だったねっ！","zh":"小紬，辛苦啦～☆　今天看到了好多人的\n舞台，太棒了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a36efc635cbcb148189a42d55a74a969c0ce9e68998db0f8fe112b8817f058d5","ja":"はい。初めてお会いする方が多かったので\n少し不安でしたが、よい経験になりました。","zh":"是的。因为有许多初次见面的人，\n虽然有点不安，但成了很好的经验。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"656b1439bf9aa29b5e21db3b82c6058209fca36a0a06e44530ecd70593ecdab6","ja":"うん！　ところでこの後、何か食べて帰らない？\nいっぱい歌って踊ったから、おなかすいちゃった。","zh":"嗯！话说待会儿要不要吃点东西再回去？\n唱唱跳跳了这么久，肚子都饿了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"56c3a906ef3b797e4a4de700d34eae491cf186758598c4076e49e07bf02cded7","ja":"そ、それでしたら、こちらのお店で甘い物は\nいかがでしょう！　以前から気になっていて！！","zh":"那、那样的话，要不要在这家店吃点甜点！\n我老早之前就在意这家店了！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5fe4b65bc45fa8d12f9a6b74bccb065ff59579b88519e40e3045196d94982ab3","ja":"和スイーツのお店？　こんなカワイイ\nかき氷があるんだ～☆　私も行ってみたい！","zh":"日式甜品店？居然还有这么可爱的\n刨冰呀～☆　我也想去看看！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"aa8220c49843bd5f8dd38b3510c94153b5de78fe5cf2759723a26c6ce33b2508","ja":"よかったです♪\nお店は、こちらにあるので……。","zh":"太好了♪\n店就在这边……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"353e3961cd5aa35dcfec631f7e7712027633e671dfd767f93cf72d12f1240c96","ja":"結構近いね！　じゃあ、着替えたら歩いていこっか？\nもっとお腹すかせて、いっぱい食べたいし！","zh":"挺近的呢！那换好衣服后，我们走着去吧？\n我还想把肚子搞得更饿一点，好好大吃一顿呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e1e41095f67bc42eb0cf8326fad0749e7a83696cffc651dfeec244739a979871","ja":"えっ！？　歩き……ですか？\n1時間以上、かかると思いますが……。","zh":"诶！？要走着去……吗？\n我觉得要花1个多小时呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"48358f3141a61bb174da369117f212055caa35ad1cc31b7775b6d3d7cdc7d7be","ja":"うん！　すっごくステキなお店だから、\nしっかりお腹の準備をしておきたいんだ♪","zh":"嗯！那家店特别棒，\n所以我想把肚子好好空出来准备大吃一顿呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"e75fa3c8076d2f89f1d7ab7a6fcf5b17ca5bda4d3b7d3f75b9897eae6ca64d2e","ja":"そんなに楽しみにしていただけるなんて……。\nそ、それなら私も、その思いに応えないと……。","zh":"能承蒙您如此期待……\n那、那样的话我也必须回应这份心意才行……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"046468ead9333856bb274e79b40b32da717f9714296766fa9d9813dfef1d724e","ja":"わかりました！\nでは、歩いて参りましょう！","zh":"明白了！\n那么，我们步行前往吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"d3c3936d4d416649010f200933f1f755fb8ac830c1a829119197de605d0d54c1","ja":"ステージでも思ったけど、やっぱり今日は暑いね～。\n日差しも強いし。熱中症には気をつけようねっ。","zh":"在台上时我也这么觉得，今天果然好热啊～。\n阳光也很刺眼。一定要小心别中暑了哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"1c4f47a1f63d5bbf3d4c53e56994de020ac45004025af648586b7a50098408ed","ja":"はい。こまめな水分補給は\n欠かさないようにしましょう。","zh":"好的。记得要经常\n补充水分哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"35fdb2d67ddf1468a48c061affb0831f2f20b3aa630d2a085ac68408ab6d1615","ja":"これでだいたい半分くらいかな？\nちょっとベンチに座って、休憩しよっか！","zh":"这样就差不多过半了吧？\n稍微去长椅上坐坐，休息一下吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1624.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"efc73124dfb879a2331f5152e2a87aabc9c20d92087b3833972146663cec281c","ja":"そうですね、少し喉が渇いてきたので水分を……はっ！\nいつの間にか、水筒が空っぽに……！？","zh":"说的也是，稍微有点口渴了，喝点水……哈！\n不知不觉间，水壶已经空了……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
